      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T13:20:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Well, Trump technically agreed to unmask ICE and get agents off the streets.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2036277067935896043",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T03:00:59+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"I would give them an F-.\" -Jen Psaki on Trump's messaging about the Iran war.\n\nVideo",
