      "timestamp": "2026-03-22T16:12:47+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Jon Favreau on what $200 billion could buy us instead of Trump's war with Iran.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2035064319029723549",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T18:41:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump's war is causing huge economic consequences, but his administration is too out of touch to be able to talk about it.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2035051486376349968",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T17:50:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Jon Favreau on AIPAC.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2035005242442449134",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T14:47:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Why the f*ck was Tulsi Gabbard in Fulton County?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2034783914514931973",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T00:07:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Either the intelligence community didn\u2019t brief Trump, or they did and he ignored it. Either way is pretty bad.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2034753214319370707",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-19T22:05:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cI don\u2019t care what she said,\u201d \u2013Donald Trump on Tulsi Gabbard\u2019s intelligence assessment.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2034733831488454898",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-19T20:48:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Here\u2019s what $200 billion could buy instead of funding war in Iran:\n\u2022 Obamacare subsidies for 22 million people for 6 years\n\u2022 Food stamps for 42 million people for 2 years\n\u2022 Free school lunches for every kid for 5 years\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2034719087838818506",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-19T19:50:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Tulsi Gabbard does what she can to try to pass the buck.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2034693861562323145",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-19T18:09:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
